WEBVTT

00:14:59.904 --> 00:15:02.972
It's like witchcraft, they turn
everything upside-down."

00:15:04.321 --> 00:15:06.556
He said, "I've got a tribunal coming up.

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:07.820
Will you come to it?"

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:09.897
So I said okay.

00:15:10.523 --> 00:15:12.007
So I went to his tribunal.

00:15:12.935 --> 00:15:16.783
And after 14 years
in Broadmoor, they let him go.

00:15:17.841 --> 00:15:20.646
They decided that he shouldn't
be held indefinitely

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:24.360
because he scores high
on a checklist that might mean

00:15:24.384 --> 00:15:28.915
that he would have a greater
than average chance of recidivism.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:31.130
So they let him go.